pcf version=2
* control data keyword
pestmode                                 estimation
noptmax                                 3
svdmode                                 1
maxsing                          10000000
eigthresh                           1e-06
eigwrite                                1
da_parameter_ensemble          initial_x_ens.csv
da_num_reals                   50
da_use_mda                     false
ies_include_base               False
da_use_simulated_states        false
ies_no_noise                   True
ies_num_threads                1
random_seed                    11111
* parameter groups external
es.pargp_data.csv
* parameter data external
es.par_data.csv
* observation data external
es.obs_data.csv
* model command line
python forward_ens.py
* model input external
es.tplfile_data.csv
* model output external
es.insfile_data.csv
